# Day 3 - users, SGs, env variables

## Ansible - create users

```yaml
- name: Create prasanta_pathnex user
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Create user prasanta_pathnex
      user:
        name: prasanta_pathnex
        shell: /bin/bash
```

## Terraform SG (r6i.4xlarge EC2)

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_security_group" "MYSG" {
  name        = "MYSG"
  description = "MYSG for SSH"

  ingress {
    from_port   = 22
    to_port     = 22
    protocol    = "tcp"
    cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
  }
}

resource "aws_instance" "MyEc2" {
  ami                    = "ami-43567ygfdcx"
  instance_type          = "r6i.4xlarge"
  vpc_security_group_ids = [aws_security_group.MYSG.id]

  tags = {
    Name = "MyEC2"
  }
}
```

## Kubernetes add env variables

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: pathnex-env-pod
spec:
  containers:
    - name: app
      image: nginx
      env:
        - name: APP_ENV
          value: "prod"
```

